#. 500 — ResetAuthenticatorKeyAsync/GetAuthenticatorKeyAsync returned nothing, which is not
#. expected to happen in practice.
#. English: Could not generate an authenticator key
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.authenticatorKeyFailed"
msgstr "Не удалось создать ключ аутентификатора"

#. English: A code from your authenticator app is required
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.codeRequired"
