#. Single sign-on accounts have no password to confirm, so minting a key or OPDS token needs a fresh sign-in.
#. English: Sign out and sign in again, then try this within 10 minutes. Creating a key or token needs a recent sign-in.
#: src/Maki.Api/Auth/AccountCredentials.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.recentSignInRequired"
