#. An authenticator code that was already used, so the next one is needed. Shown only after the
#. password was verified, so it says nothing about which accounts exist.
#. English: That code was already used. Wait for the next one and try again
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.totpReplayed"
msgstr "Этот код уже использован. Дождитесь следующего и попробуйте снова"

#. The two-factor enrolment code was rejected. Distinct from error.auth.invalidCode, which is the
#. sign-in-time 2FA prompt.
#. English: That code is not valid
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.invalidCode"
msgstr "Этот код недействителен"

#. {ratings} is the comma-separated list of valid content rating codes (ContentRating.All), not
#. translated. Same text as error.users.invalidContentRating but a different caller (a user setting
#. their own ceiling here, an admin setting someone else's there).
#. English: Rating must be one of: {ratings}
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AccountController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.account.invalidContentRating"
msgstr "Рейтинг должен быть одним из: {ratings}"

#. JsonStringEnumConverter accepts the underlying numeric value of an enum as well as its name, so
