#. auth.requirehttps is on but the browser is on a plain-HTTP, non-localhost address, so it would
#. discard the Secure session cookie and every request after sign-in would 401.
#. English: This server requires HTTPS, so your browser would drop the sign-in. Open Maki through its https:// address, or turn off Require HTTPS in Settings (it can be reached from http://localhost on the server).
#: src/Maki.Api/Controllers/AuthController.cs
#, fuzzy
msgid "error.auth.httpsRequired"
msgstr "Этот сервер требует HTTPS, поэтому браузер отбросил бы вход. Откройте Maki по адресу https:// или отключите «Требовать HTTPS» в Настройках (они доступны по адресу http://localhost на сервере)."

#. Also shared across several distinct two-factor failures (missing code, expired 2FA cookie,
